title: Five Spot
text: A die showing five. The spots are the only places on it you can use.
trick: an occupied die leaves only its five spots free; red crosses the face corner to corner, blue runs along its foot
motif: die face: 5x5 block of occupied squares with five free spots
ink: 4
expect: depth>=3
